'''13th Anniv. Doge Cake''' (13周年記念ケーキわんこ, ''Jūsan Shūnen Kinen Kēki Wanko'', '''13th Anniversary Celebration Cake Doge''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Anniversary|B-Day Gifts]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 13th Anniv. Doge Cake
|image = E 759.png
|first appearance = [[13 Years of Fun!|Birthday Present!]]
|money drop = 7¢ - 27¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be four [[Kaijin Doge]]s carrying a large birthday cake that stands on a can of Cat Food. The villains remain hidden under the can, but go in for a bite when the time is right! Although it may not look like one, it is actually a Metal enemy.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

==Encounters==
